sts green, offline; miner determinism byte-identical; Docker grading smoke: gold patch → RESOLVED; 8+ mutation checks across the campaign, each proven to fail its test when reverted.\n\n**What this PR does NOT include**: no paid runs. The ladder (null test → pilot → confirmatory) and the human seal session (350-pair slate + per-rater packets are ready in review/) are gated behind explicit go decisions.","created_at":"2026-08-19T14:35:15Z","draft":false,"head":"feat/brainmark","head_repo":"entireio/entire-brain","html_url":"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/88","number":88,"sha":"e56f4428ed7644b99a45c3fc325738f21b58445d","title":"BrainMark: sealed cross-session memory benchmark (A→B pairs, 6 arms, NeurIPS-grade harness)","updated_at":"2026-08-21T13:48:20Z"}
